itle\": \"Thank you for saying it. Right now, are you safe from acting on it?\", \"safety_open\": \"Talk to someone now\", \"settle_line\": \"Your body's loud. Settle it first. The rest can wait, and Today will ask you about it later.\", \"wait_back\": \"I'm back\", \"wait_done\": \"That's the wait. Come back to it when you're ready.\", \"wait_done_short\": \"Done\", \"wait_title\": \"Phone down. The pull can wait with it.\", \"wait_waiting\": \"Put the phone face down and come back when you're ready. It'll still be here.\"}", s.tablesJson = "{}", s.deriveJson = "[]";
